# Working scratch: ~410 MB of source images/video that the site never serves —
# the published derivatives all live in public/images/. Keep the BINARIES out of
# git but keep the research .md/.csv inside these folders tracked (2026-07-30).
# assets/brand/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it holds the masters, and CLAUDE.md,
# the skills, the agents and docs reference those paths 84 times.
assets/1WORKING-ON/**
!assets/1WORKING-ON/**/
!assets/1WORKING-ON/**/*.md
!assets/1WORKING-ON/**/*.csv
assets/COMPARE-PAGES/**
!assets/COMPARE-PAGES/**/
!assets/COMPARE-PAGES/**/*.md
!assets/COMPARE-PAGES/**/*.csv
assets/ScreenShots/**
!assets/ScreenShots/**/
!assets/ScreenShots/**/*.md
!assets/ScreenShots/**/*.csv

# render harness
